# Glacier Notes ships only inside an Android WebView, so the build targets Chromium alone.
# The floor is Angular 22's own baseline (Chrome 111) — anything lower makes the build
# emit an "Unsupported browsers" warning. Android System WebView updates independently of
# the OS, so this is compatible with minSdk 24.
# See: https://angular.dev/reference/versions#browser-support

Chrome >= 111
ChromeAndroid >= 111
